-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-Party Dependencies and Binary Distribution Notice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

While the primary source code of this repository is distributed under the MIT
License above, compiled firmware binaries statically link against external
libraries that carry distinct open-source licenses:

1. nRF24/RF24:
   - License: GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0-only)
   - Scope: nRF24L01+ transceiver SPI register driver

2. ESPAsyncWebServer:
   - License: GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0)
   - Scope: Asynchronous HTTP and WebSocket server runtime

3. RadioLib:
   - License: MIT License
   - Scope: CC1101 Sub-GHz transceiver physical layer driver

4. ArduinoJson:
   - License: MIT License
   - Scope: Serialization and deserialization of WebSocket telemetry payloads

5. Adafruit SSD1306 & Adafruit GFX Library:
   - License: BSD 3-Clause License
   - Scope: Framebuffer graphic primitives for I2C OLED display

Under the terms of the GNU General Public License v2.0, any pre-compiled firmware
binary distribution that incorporates the GPL-licensed RF24 library must be
distributed in full compliance with GPL-2.0 copyleft obligations. Source code
authored specifically within this project remains independently licensed under
the MIT License.
